From kingaa at umich.edu  Mon Oct 18 15:41:28 2010
From: kingaa at umich.edu (Aaron A. King)
Date: Mon, 18 Oct 2010 09:41:28 -0400
Subject: [pomp-announce] pomp version 0.34-2 released
Message-ID: <201010180941.32743.kingaa@umich.edu>

This is a bug fix release, with some minor new features added.  In particular,
1. a method has been added to coerce 'probed.pomp' objects to 'data.frame' 
objects.
2. a bug introduced in 0.34-1 associated with running 'simulate' on objects 
that inherit from 'pomp' but are not themselves pomps has been fixed.  Now, 
as before 0.34-1, 'simulate' returns 'pomp' objects when obs=F and states=F, 
regardless of what class 'object' is.
3. 'simulate' and 'rprocess' are accelerated somewhat through judicious use 
of 'memcpy'.


